{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_030iku_1000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_030iku_1000_situation", "source_sha256": "68cf306c064d4c7ad745bab2b3478f4c49b0239d8a8ddb4104741ab907b4204d", "ja": "映画オーディション　直前", "zh": "电影试镜　开始前", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_030iku_1000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_030iku_1000_place", "source_sha256": "dc2eab181b21579d24af8758a5c8880d3a25c4048161584a8837b0a8c92754ca", "ja": "控え室", "zh": "准备室", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_030iku_1000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_030iku_1001_p", "source_sha256": "4c19c088b2b68d45c2be9cfa024a8d634f79410fc973a2436f3cee9920ca6f99", "ja": "いよいよ次は、育の審査だけど……。\n本当に大丈夫か、育？", "zh": "下一个终于轮到育的评选了……\n真的没问题吗，育？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_030iku_1000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_030iku_1002_030iku", "source_sha256": "99d3840e1dbadcc085aba33bedfe3b23c8ad8be27e36995c70be7bbd9e78ed9a", "ja": "……もうっ！\n{$P$}さん、それ言うの、何回め？", "zh": "……真是的！\n{$P$}先生，你这是说第几次了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_030iku_1000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_030iku_1003_030iku", "source_sha256": "3ea1a64cc1a1e25f24915827d1ee76b9222ecbda066be4edb18ac22392005169", "ja": "だいじょうぶだよ。わたし、\nオーディションなら、前にも受けたことあるもん。", "zh": "没问题喔，\n我之前也参加过试镜了嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_030iku_1000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_030iku_1004_030iku", "source_sha256": "76015e04eba687e086f222c896e33ab2cea4d1a7971788ec34a793bad8ae1fb8", "ja": "小さいからって、あんまり子どもあつかい\nしないでねっ？", "zh": "就算我个子小，\n你也不要一直把我当小孩子啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_030iku_1000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_030iku_1005_p", "source_sha256": "edf95a0300f40ca253e98a339ba7798e72127e3808f0c2a8a77f14bcbf00006a", "ja": "そ、そうか。ごめん、\n育の方が俺より落ち着いてるな……。", "zh": "这、这样啊，抱歉，\n育比我还要冷静呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_030iku_1000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_030iku_1006_030iku", "source_sha256": "489816c58d69c4e4668fb9fcbf766b3978c8e6f9da604220b2c64e0128ec3388", "ja": "あっ、わたしの番号がよばれてる！　じゃあ\n行ってくるね、{$P$}さんっ！", "zh": "啊，叫到我的号码了！\n那我就先过去啰，{$P$}先生！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
